@wtdcode The three remaining failures in [CI #95770](https://buildkite.com/vllm/ci/builds/95770) come from the new `test_swizzle_mxfp4_pins_epilogue_subtile` running on AMD:
- MI300 MoE shards 2/5: the constraints remain {} because _swizzle_mxfp4 only applies them on CUDA.
- MI355 FP8 MoE: the ROCm path raises tensor model parallel group is not initialized.

Could you restrict this test to CUDA and rerun CI? A guard like this should address these failures:
```python
@pytest.mark.skipif(
    not current_platform.is_cuda(),
    reason="CUDA-specific opt-flag constraints",
)
```

